    <string name="health_rationale_title">How Octop Bot uses your health data</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_text">When you turn on Settings → Device connectors → Health, Octop Bot reads daily totals and averages (steps, active energy, exercise minutes, sleep, heart rate, resting heart rate and weight) from Health Connect, only when a Bot asks for them in a chat. The values are sent with that chat to the model that answers you, and are not stored anywhere else by Octop Bot. Octop Bot never writes health data. Turn the switch off, or revoke access in Health Connect, at any time.</string>
